# Loops: Repeat a fixed number of times, then While a condition holds.
#
# Sum the input (35), double it three times (280), then subtract 30 while
# the value stays above 100 — landing exactly on 100. The Binding Vow is a
# debug assertion: try breaking the input and re-running, then shed the vow
# with --release.
#
#   domain examples/07_loops.domain
#   Expected output: 100
Cursed Energy: 07_loops.input
Shikigami: Ints
Binding Vow: All Values > 0
Maximum Technique: Sum
Simple Domain: Repeat 3
    Cursed Technique: Apply
        Using: (v) -> v * 2
Simple Domain: While
    Using: (v) -> v > 100
    Cursed Technique: Apply
        Using: (v) -> v - 30
Reveal: stdout
